      QP_BLOB
     /* QP BLOB version                       */ 0x101
     /* hardware trigger                      */ 16
     /* trigger type                          */ INDIRECT
     /* raster priority [1..32]               */ 28
     /* assignment measurement/bypass         */ MEASUREMENT
